{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22110","headline":"和钱员外禁中夙兴见示 · 白居易","name":"和钱员外禁中夙兴见示","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"窗白星汉曙，窗暖灯火余。\n坐卷朱里幕，看封紫泥书。\n窅窅钟漏尽，曈曈霞景初。\n楼台红照曜，松竹青扶疎。\n君爱此时好，回头特谓余。\n不知上清界，晓景复何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22110.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22110","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}